  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.0 }}>画完圈、分完维，第 7 篇《男女有别》换回接龙。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#B4552D', lineHeight: 2.0, marginTop: 10 }}>为什么？因为它又在往前推了。</Text>
